\ Test structured error objects with recover
\ Note: recover-quot has declared effect ( error -- ) so must consume the error

\ Simple error - print the error object showing stack trace
[ drop ] [ dup . drop ] recover

\ Nested error - should show full call chain in stack trace
nested-fail: [ drop ] ;
outer-fail: [ nested-fail ] ;
[ outer-fail ] [ dup . drop ] recover

\ Unknown word error - different error type
[ unknown-word-xyz ] [ dup . drop ] recover

\ Rethrow - catch an error, then re-raise it
\ The outer recover catches the rethrown error
[ [ drop ] [ rethrow ] recover ] [ dup . drop ] recover
